---
import { appLink } from '../lib/app-link';
---
<section class="hero" id="inicio" data-chapter="paper" aria-labelledby="t-hero">
  <h1 id="t-hero"><span class="l1">Tus gastos,</span> <span class="l2">a la vista.</span></h1>
  <div class="hero-foot on-field">
    <p>Conecta tu banco y tu sueldo y tus gastos llegan solos. Fin de Mes proyecta tu saldo mes a mes y te muestra qué cambia con una compra en cuotas antes de que decidas.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="btn btn-solid" href={appLink('/registro', { conectar: 'fintoc' })}>Conectar mi banco</a>
      <a href={appLink('/demo')}>Probar con un ejemplo</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style is:global>
.hero {
  min-height: clamp(560px, 80svh, 760px); background: var(--field-1); color: var(--field-1-ink);
  padding: 0 var(--gutter); display: grid; grid-template-rows: clamp(96px, 14svh, 140px) auto minmax(48px, 1fr) auto;
}
.hero h1 { grid-row: 2; font-size: var(--step-display); line-height: 0.84; letter-spacing: -0.035em; margin-left: -0.04em; }
.hero h1 .l1 { display: block; color: var(--field-1-pale); }
.hero h1 .l2 { display: block; color: var(--field-1-ink); }
.hero-foot { grid-row: 4; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr); gap: 24px; align-items: end; padding-bottom: clamp(24px, 6svh, 64px); }
.hero-foot p { grid-column: 1 / 7; font-size: var(--step-lead); line-height: 1.35; max-width: 34ch; }
.hero-foot .actions { grid-column: 8 / 13; justify-self: end; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px 24px; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-end; }
.hero-foot .actions a:not(.btn) { padding: 12px 0; }
@media (max-width: 760px) {
  .hero h1 { font-size: 13.5vw; line-height: 0.9; }
  .hero-foot p, .hero-foot .actions { grid-column: 1 / -1; justify-self: start; justify-content: flex-start; }
}

.js .hero h1 .l1, .js .hero h1 .l2 { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(0.18em); animation: up 900ms var(--ease-out) forwards; }
.js .hero h1 .l2 { animation-delay: 120ms; }
.js .hero-foot > * { opacity: 0; animation: fade 700ms var(--ease-out) 420ms forwards; }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .js .hero h1 .l1, .js .hero h1 .l2, .js .hero-foot > * { opacity: 1; transform: none; animation: none; transition: opacity 200ms linear; }
}
</style>
